    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive the restaurant passed down from your grandmother and aim for a three-star rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a fairy tale world where you\u2019ll battle enemies and gather ingredients in action-packed,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while also hiring and training staff to manage your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a blend of <u><strong>restaurant management and fairy tale action</strong></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></strong><u>Fairy Tale Action<strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Ingredients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fairy tale world and collect all kinds of ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat creatures, and you might just find rare, high-quality ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you gather, the more delicious dishes you can serve at your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/c88aab31b36e49589568ea2af1af7304.poster.avif?t=1751926731\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/c88aab31b36e49589568ea2af1af7304.webm?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/c88aab31b36e49589568ea2af1af7304.mp4?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fairy Tale Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful abilities inspired by fairy tale characters in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them strategically to turn the tide of the fight in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/e9801bbe77991e2b59fa4df72ca0891e.poster.avif?t=1751926731\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/e9801bbe77991e2b59fa4df72ca0891e.webm?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/e9801bbe77991e2b59fa4df72ca0891e.mp4?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ingredients you\u2019ve gathered to prepare delicious dishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meals can restore your HP, inflict status effects on enemies, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stockpile ingredients or cook up powerful meals to take down tough foes? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/f9a29dcc3ecc2adee0feaa6edfd19187.avif?t=1751926731\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000Restaurant Management\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to work at your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign them to roles that match their strengths to keep your business running efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/6b190362305bf558590c7b6860cf4b51.avif?t=1751926731\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>During Business Hours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events occur while your restaurant is open!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attracting customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning the restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serving dishes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing with troublesome guests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle these tasks efficiently to keep your customers happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/2f1e717d83b2a25b3d35892082d620c0.poster.avif?t=1751926731\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/2f1e717d83b2a25b3d35892082d620c0.webm?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/2f1e717d83b2a25b3d35892082d620c0.mp4?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u00a0\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></strong><u>Other Features<strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u00a0</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently boost your stats by eating special dishes during action sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stages and recipes through exciting challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u00a0\u3000\u3000\u3000Streaming Guidelines\u3000\u3000\u3000\u00a0</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to upload and stream videos without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or gameplay coverage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><i>Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive the restaurant passed down from your grandmother and aim for a three-star rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a fairy tale world where you\u2019ll battle enemies and gather ingredients in action-packed,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while also hiring and training staff to manage your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a blend of <u><strong>restaurant management and fairy tale action</strong></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></strong><u>Fairy Tale Action<strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Ingredients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fairy tale world and collect all kinds of ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat creatures, and you might just find rare, high-quality ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you gather, the more delicious dishes you can serve at your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/c88aab31b36e49589568ea2af1af7304.poster.avif?t=1751926731\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/c88aab31b36e49589568ea2af1af7304.webm?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/c88aab31b36e49589568ea2af1af7304.mp4?t=1751926731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fairy Tale Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful abilities inspired by fairy tale characters in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Us