ideos without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or gameplay coverage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><i>Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</i></p>",
